Description
This Android application helps users manage campsite gear using parallel arrays, loops, and multi-screen navigation.

Features
- Splash screen introduction
- Main screen displaying total items packed
- Detailed screen showing full gear list
- Navigation between screens
- Dark themed UI

Data Structures
The app uses parallel arrays:
- items[]
- categories[]
- quantities[]
- notes[]

Functionality
- Loop calculates total number of items
- Intent navigation between screens
- Back button returns to main screen


